        <mxCell id="PFD-NOTE-BOX" value="&lt;b&gt;DESIGN NOTE / STATUS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;All material flow, composition, T, P and enthalpy values are uncalculated and intentionally blank.&lt;br&gt;Draft-only anchors: 7 MPa(a) and 250 C synthesis; not approved design values.&lt;br&gt;CO2 &gt;=99.5 mol% dry and H2 &gt;=99.9 mol% dry are screening targets, not vendor guarantees." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#C58A00;fontColor=#3E3E3E;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
